---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
import { GITHUB_URL, REPO_URL } from '../consts';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About this blog and the homelab behind it."
	pubDate={new Date('2026-10-31')}
>
	<p>
		I'm Majid Mvulle, a software engineer who runs a Kubernetes homelab for fun and learning. This
		blog documents the journey: hardware choices, GitOps patterns, networking, storage, backups,
		and the mistakes along the way.
	</p>
	<p>
		The cluster configuration lives in <a href={REPO_URL}>the public homelab repo</a>, and you can
		find my other work on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
